This is a first version of a classic text-based RPG. In this game You can:

Explore, fight, level up and more!

IMPORTANT:

The "Explore" feature has 3 options. Fight, Found something and Nothing happened. Sometimes You want to press "Explore" a couple times...

HOW TO PLAY:

1. Open "Classic RPG" folder

2. Choose "game.py"

3. Launch and enjoy!

(checked on Python 3.14.7)

UPDATE:

Added tests

to try those put this command into terminal "pip install pytest" and after installing put "pytest -v"